  "factor_name": "Range-location gated medium-term continuation",
  "version": "1.0",
  "calculation": {
    "expression": "rolling_return(close,10) * (2 * (close - rolling_min(close,60)) / (rolling_max(close,60) - rolling_min(close,60)) - 1)",
    "description": "Multiply each asset's 10-trading-day return by its normalized location within its own trailing 60-day price range. Positive returns near the upper range and negative returns near the lower range receive stronger continuation scores; moves against range location are penalized. This is cross-asset rankable and avoids price-level comparisons."
  },
